{"issue":{"base_status":"closed","close_reason":"Animation storytelling, plan, bead-rs tracking, validation, and publication completed","closed_at":"2026-09-27T13:28:02.346285842Z","comments":[],"created_at":"2026-09-27T13:20:51.60848169Z","data":{},"description":"Rework the README benchmark GIF into a clear staged-change narrative using anticipation, easing, overshoot and settle, secondary motion, completion beats, and a readable final hold. Add a reproducible render path, plan.md, validate the artifact and secret-safety, then commit and publish through Forgejo.","external_references":[{"key":"unique-ref","namespace":"codex","unique_ref":true,"value":"benchmark-gif-storytelling"}],"id":"fss-501e2518","issue_type":"improvement","labels":["animation","documentation"],"manual_blocked":false,"notes":"Completed paths: assets/benchmark.gif, assets/benchmark-source-v2.png, scripts/render-benchmark-gif.sh, plan.md, AGENTS.md, README.md, .needle.yaml, and .beads checkpoint. Narrative includes setup, anticipation, eased timing, secret-scanner overshoot/settle, secondary trails/ripples, staggered completion, final hold, and dramatized-timing disclosure. Verification: deterministic rerender SHA-256 matched; GIF 960x540, 117 frames, 6.5 seconds, 348990 bytes; labels matched research/benchmark-results.tsv; contact sheet reviewed at half size; bash -n, cargo fmt --check, git diff --check, bead doctor, secret-scanner staged scan, Gitleaks staged scan, and Gitleaks directory scan passed. Implementation commit 64a55e9 pushed to Forgejo main.","priority":2,"profile":"native-v1","revision":4,"schema_ref":"urn:bead-rs:schema:issue:native-v1","title":"Increase benchmark GIF storytelling","updated_at":"2026-09-27T13:28:02.346285842Z"},"record_type":"issue"}
