{"issue":{"assignee":"codex","base_status":"closed","claim_epoch":1,"close_reason":"Incremental worktree scan, redaction tests, and latency benchmark complete","closed_at":"2026-09-29T03:35:13.921670206Z","comments":[],"created_at":"2026-09-27T13:34:04.662821852Z","data":{},"description":"Add a --worktree scan surface for coding-agent hooks. Scan staged and unstaged added lines relative to HEAD plus complete untracked text files, without mutating the index. Preserve redacted path:line:rule output and exit statuses 0 clean, 1 findings, 2 execution error. Cover spaces, renames, deletions, unborn repositories, untracked files, and staged-plus-unstaged edits with unit and CLI tests; record an end-to-end latency benchmark.","external_references":[{"key":"unique-ref","namespace":"roadmap","unique_ref":true,"value":"agent-hooks-worktree"}],"id":"fss-cb646d6c","issue_type":"feature","labels":["agent-hooks","rust","scanner"],"manual_blocked":false,"notes":"Implemented --worktree using staged and unstaged zero-context diffs plus complete untracked regular files; index remains untouched. Covers unborn repo, spaces in paths, partial staging, deletions and renames through no-renames diffs. Added --patch-stdin in same CLI for server bead. Paths: src/git.rs, src/lib.rs, src/main.rs, tests/cli.rs, plan.md, docs/adr/0001-fleet-secret-scan.md, research/worktree-benchmark-2026-09-28.tsv. Verified cargo fmt --check, cargo test (10 tests), cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings, cargo build --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl, git diff --check, Rust --worktree clean. 30-run host median: staged 2.7 ms, worktree 13.8 ms. Server integration remains on separate bead.","priority":1,"profile":"native-v1","resource_keys":["src:cli","src:git"],"revision":5,"schema_ref":"urn:bead-rs:schema:issue:native-v1","title":"Add incremental worktree scanning","updated_at":"2026-09-29T03:35:13.921670206Z"},"record_type":"issue"}
